#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:5
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant/urban_piper.rst:165
msgid "Point of Sale"
msgstr "Point de Vente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo **Point of Sale** is designed for managing shops and restaurants. It is "
"web-browser-based, allowing it to run on any device, and is built to "
"maintain functionality even during temporary network outages."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **Point de Vente** est conçu pour gérer les magasins et restaurants. Il "
"fonctionne dans un navigateur web, ce qui lui permet de s'exécuter sur "
"n'importe quel appareil, et est conçu pour maintenir sa fonctionnalité même "
"en cas de pannes réseau temporaires."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:11
msgid ""
"Beyond traditional :doc:`store <point_of_sale/shop>` and :doc:`restaurant "
"<point_of_sale/restaurant>` settings, Odoo :abbr:`POS (Point of Sale)` also "
"supports a :doc:`self-ordering <point_of_sale/extra/self_order>` feature, "
"enabling customers to place orders and make payments using a dedicated kiosk "
"or their own mobile device."
msgstr ""
"Au-delà des configurations traditionnelles de :doc:`magasin <point_of_sale/"
"shop>` et de :doc:`restaurant <point_of_sale/restaurant>`, Odoo :abbr:`PdV "
"(Point de Vente)` prend également en charge une fonctionnalité "
"de :doc:`commande en libre-service <point_of_sale/extra/self_order>`, "
"permettant aux clients de passer des commandes et d'effectuer des paiements "
"à l'aide d'une borne dédiée ou de leur propre appareil mobile."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:18
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:5
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "Flux de travail"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:18
msgid "Set up a POS, manage basic settings, and handle daily operations."
msgstr ""
"Configurer un point de vente, gérer les paramètres de base et gérer les "
"opérations quotidiennes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:5
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant/urban_piper.rst:205
msgid "Products"
msgstr "Produits"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:23
msgid "Configure products, categories, combos, and serial number displays."
msgstr ""
"Configurer les produits, catégories, combos et affichages des numéros de "
"série."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:5
msgid "Hardware and network"
msgstr "Matériel et réseau"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:28
msgid "Connect and configure hardware peripherals and network settings."
msgstr ""
"Connecter et configurer les périphériques matériels et les paramètres réseau."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:5
msgid "Shop features"
msgstr "Fonctionnalités de boutique"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:33
msgid ""
"Features specific to retail: manage quotations, \"ship later\" orders, and "
"barcodes."
msgstr ""
"Fonctionnalités spécifiques à la vente au détail : gérer les devis, les "
"commandes \"expédier plus tard\" et les codes-barres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:38
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:5
msgid "Restaurant features"
msgstr "Fonctionnalités de restaurant"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:38
msgid ""
"Features specific to restaurants: manage floors, tables, tips, and online "
"delivery."
msgstr ""
"Fonctionnalités spécifiques aux restaurants : gérer les salles, les tables, "
"les pourboires et la livraison en ligne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:43
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:5
msgid "Extra features"
msgstr "Fonctionnalités supplémentaires"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:43
msgid ""
"Shared features: manage employees, preparation displays, self-ordering, and "
"loyalty programs."
msgstr ""
"Fonctionnalités partagées : gérer les employés, les écrans de préparation, "
"la commande autonome et les programmes de fidélité."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:5
msgid "Payment methods"
msgstr "Modes de paiement"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:48
msgid ""
"Configure cash and card payments, cash machines, customer accounts, QR "
"codes, and payment terminals."
msgstr ""
"Configurer les paiements en espèces et par carte, les caisses, les comptes "
"clients, les codes QR et les terminaux de paiement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/reporting.rst:3
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr "Analyse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:54
msgid "View and analyze orders and sessions' statistics."
msgstr "Consulter et analyser les statistiques des commandes et des sessions."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:60
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Point of Sale tutorials <https://www.odoo.com/slides/point-"
"of-sale-28>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tutoriels Odoo : Tutoriels Point de Vente <https://www.odoo.com/slides/"
"point-of-sale-28>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:7
msgid ""
"This section covers features common to both :doc:`retail <shop>` "
"and :doc:`restaurant <restaurant>` settings, including employee management, "
"pricing rules, and self-ordering."
msgstr ""
"Cette section couvre les fonctionnalités communes aux "
"environnements :doc:`vente au détail <shop>` et :doc:`restaurant "
"<restaurant>`, y compris la gestion des employés, les règles de tarification "
"et la commande autonome."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:12
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:3
msgid "Multi-employee management"
msgstr "Gestion de plusieurs employés"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:12
msgid ""
"Allow multiple employees to log into a single POS register with specific "
"roles."
msgstr ""
"Permettre à plusieurs employés de se connecter à un seul point de vente avec "
"des rôles spécifiques."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:18
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:3
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:56
msgid "Preparation display"
msgstr "Écran de préparation"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:18
msgid ""
"Use dedicated screens to track order preparation stages, and inform "
"customers when their order is ready for pickup."
msgstr ""
"Utiliser des écrans dédiés pour suivre les étapes de préparation des "
"commandes et informer les clients lorsque leur commande est prête à être "
"retirée."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:25
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:3
msgid "Self-ordering"
msgstr "Commande autonome"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:25
msgid ""
"Set up self-ordering to allow customers to place orders via QR codes on "
"their own devices or through a dedicated kiosk."
msgstr ""
"Configurer la commande autonome pour permettre aux clients de passer des "
"commandes via des codes QR sur leurs propres appareils ou via une borne "
"dédiée."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:32
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/presets.rst:3
msgid "Presets"
msgstr "Préréglages"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:32
msgid ""
"Apply predefined configurations to orders, such as specific pricelists, "
"taxes, or return modes."
msgstr ""
"Appliquer des configurations prédéfinies aux commandes, telles que des "
"listes de prix spécifiques, des taxes ou des modes de retour."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:39
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:8
msgid "Pricing features"
msgstr "Fonctionnalités de tarification"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:39
msgid ""
"Configure advanced pricing rules including manual or automatic discounts, "
"loyalty programs, cash rounding, pricelists, and fiscal positions."
msgstr ""
"Configurer des règles de tarification avancées incluant les remises "
"manuelles ou automatiques, les programmes de fidélité, l'arrondi des "
"espèces, les listes de prix et les positions fiscales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo Point of Sale allows you to :ref:`configure different access levels "
"<pos/employee_login/configuration>` for employees and define which ones are "
"authorized to log in to the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/open-register>` and "
"switch between employees :ref:`using a PIN code or an employee badge <pos/"
"employee-login/user-login>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Point de Vente vous permet de :ref:`configurer différents niveaux "
"d'accès <pos/employee_login/configuration>` pour les employés et de définir "
"ceux qui sont autorisés à se connecter à la :ref:`caisse du point de vente "
"<pos/use/open-register>` et de changer d'employé :ref:`à l'aide d'un code "
"PIN ou d'un badge d'employé <pos/employee-login/user-login>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:15
