#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:348
msgid "PIN code setup"
msgstr "Configuration du code PIN"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:350
msgid ""
"For enhanced security, employees can be required to enter a PIN code each "
"time they log in to the POS register. To set up a PIN code for an employee:"
msgstr ""
"Pour renforcer la sécurité, les employés peuvent être tenus de saisir un "
