#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:66
msgid ""
"To temporarily make the product unavailable for sale in the POS register "
"or :doc:`self-ordering menu <extra/self_order>`, click :guilabel:`Snooze`, "
"select the desired duration, and click :guilabel:`Apply`. To reactivate the "
"product before the set period ends, long-click the product in the register, "
"click the countdown timer, then, in the :guilabel:`Stop Snooze` popover, "
"click :guilabel:`Yes` to confirm."
