msgid "Product units"
msgstr "Unités de produit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:241
msgid ""
"Products can be grouped by :doc:`unit of measure </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/uom>` in "
"the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/open-register>` and on the :doc:`customer "
"display <hardware_network/customer_display>`."
msgstr ""
"Les produits peuvent être regroupés par :doc:`unité de mesure </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/uom>` dans "
"le :ref:`Point de Vente <pos/use/open-register>` et sur l':doc:`écran client "
"<hardware_network/customer_display>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:246
msgid "To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Pour ce faire, suivre ces étapes :"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:248
msgid ""
"Enable :ref:`Units of Measure & Packagings <inventory/product_replenishment/"
"configuration>` in the Invoicing app settings."
msgstr ""
"Activer :ref:`Unités de mesure & conditionnements <inventory/"
"product_replenishment/configuration>` dans les paramètres de l'application "
"Facturation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:250
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Units & Packagings` link to view "
"all configured units."
msgstr ""
"Cliquer sur le lien :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Unités & "
"Conditionnements` pour afficher toutes les unités configurées."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:252
msgid "Select a unit."
msgstr "Sélectionner une unité."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:253
msgid "Activate :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`."
msgstr "Activer le :ref:`mode développeur <developer-mode>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:254
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Group Products in POS`."
msgstr "Activer :guilabel:`Regrouper les produits dans le Point de Vente`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:258
msgid ""
"When a customer orders multiple units of the same product, the products are "
"grouped into a single line rather than appearing individually. The unit "
"price is displayed below the product, and the total amount appears next to "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'un client commande plusieurs unités du même produit, les produits "
"sont regroupés en une seule ligne plutôt que d'apparaître individuellement. "
"Le prix unitaire est affiché sous le produit et le montant total apparaît à "
"côté."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:262
