msgstr "Faire défiler jusqu'à la section :guilabel:`Food Delivery Connector`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant/urban_piper.rst:157
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Fill this form to get Username & Api key` and fill out the "
