"ou :guilabel:`Mobile` rempli."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:225
msgid ""
"Make sure a customer is assigned to the order to send marketing messages "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"Assurez-vous qu'un client est assigné à la commande pour envoyer des "
"messages marketing manuellement."

