"Click :guilabel:`Create Invoice` and select :guilabel:`Regular invoice` from "
"the *Create invoice(s)* pop-up window. Click :guilabel:`Create Draft` to "
"generate the invoice. After verifying that the draft is correct, "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm`, then click :guilabel:`Send` to email the invoice "
"to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Cliquer sur :guilabel:`Créer une facture` et sélectionner :guilabel:`Facture "
"standard` dans la fenêtre contextuelle *Créer les factures*. Cliquer "
"sur :guilabel:`Créer un brouillon` pour générer la facture. Après avoir "
"vérifié que le brouillon est correct, cliquer sur :guilabel:`Confirmer`, "
"puis cliquer sur :guilabel:`Envoyer` pour envoyer la facture par e-mail au "
"client."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:133
msgid "A confirmed invoice for a rental deposit."
msgstr "Une facture confirmée pour une caution de location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:136
msgid ""
"For in-person transactions, click :guilabel:`Pay`, verify the *Pay* pop-up "
"window, then click :guilabel:`Create Payment` and click :guilabel:`Send` to "
"email a copy of the receipt."
msgstr ""
"Pour les transactions en personne, cliquer sur :guilabel:`Payer`, vérifier "
"la fenêtre contextuelle *Payer*, puis cliquer sur :guilabel:`Créer un "
"paiement` et cliquer sur :guilabel:`Envoyer` pour envoyer une copie du reçu "
"par e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:142
msgid "Refund deposits upon return"
msgstr "Rembourser les acomptes lors du retour"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:144
msgid ""
"To process a deposit return, the **Accounting** app must be installed. After "
"a customer :ref:`returns the rented item <rental/pickup_return/return>`, "
"begin the deposit return by preparing a :doc:`credit note <../../../finance/"
"accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` against the original deposit "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"Pour traiter le retour d'une caution, l'application **Comptabilité** doit "
"être installée. Après qu'un client :ref:`retourne l'article loué <rental/"
"pickup_return/return>`, commencer le retour de la caution en préparant "
"une :doc:`note de crédit <../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/"
"credit_notes>` liée à la facture de caution d'origine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:149
msgid ""
"First, go to the :menuselection:`Rental app --> Orders --> Orders`, and "
"select the correct rental order. Click the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-"
"o` :guilabel:`Invoices` smart button, find the invoice for the deposit, "
"and :ref:`issue a credit note <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>`."
msgstr ""
"Tout d'abord, aller à :menuselection:`Application Location --> Commandes --> "
"Commandes` et sélectionner la bonne commande de location. Cliquer sur le "
"bouton intelligent :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Factures`, trouver "
"la facture pour la caution et :ref:`émettre une note de crédit <accounting/"
"credit_notes/issue-credit-note>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:153
msgid "A paid deposit invoice to show the Credit Note button."
msgstr "Une facture de caution payée pour afficher le bouton Note de crédit."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:157
msgid ""
"When creating a credit note, enter `Security Deposit Refund` in "
"the :guilabel:`Reason displayed on Credit Note` field in the *Credit Note* "
"pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Lors de la création d'une note de crédit, saisir `Security Deposit Refund` "
"dans le champ :guilabel:`Motif affiché sur la note de crédit` de la fenêtre "
"contextuelle *Note de crédit*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:160
msgid ""
"Credit Note pop-up window with Security Deposit Refund entered in the Reason "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Fenêtre contextuelle Note de crédit avec Security Deposit Refund saisi dans "
"le champ Motif."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:163
msgid ""
"Return to the rental order using the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-"
"o` :guilabel:`Sales Orders` smart button. For the deposit order line, change "
"the :guilabel:`Delivered` quantity from `1` to `0`. This step ensures the "
"deposit is marked as returned."
msgstr ""
"Revenir à la commande de location à l'aide du bouton intelligent :icon:`fa-"
"pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Bons de commande`. Pour la ligne de commande du "
"dépôt de garantie, modifier la quantité :guilabel:`Livré` de `1` à `0`. "
"Cette étape permet de s'assurer que le dépôt de garantie est marqué comme "
"restitué."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:167
msgid ""
"Then, review any rental refunds due before creating a final invoice for the "
"remaining charges by clicking :guilabel:`Create Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Vérifier ensuite les éventuelles notes de crédit de location dues avant de "
"créer une facture finale pour les frais restants en cliquant "
"sur :guilabel:`Créer une facture`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:170
msgid ""
"In the draft invoice, the deposit line will appear as a negative amount, "
"which shows the amount to refund. At the bottom, review "
"the :guilabel:`Outstanding Credits` section for the credit note created for "
"the deposit refund."
msgstr ""
"Dans le brouillon de facture, la ligne du dépôt de garantie apparaît sous la "
"forme d'un montant négatif, indiquant le montant à rembourser. En bas, "
"vérifier la section :guilabel:`Crédits en cours` pour la note de crédit "
"créée pour le remboursement du dépôt de garantie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:174
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add` to apply these credits to the invoice. This completes "
"the refund process."
msgstr ""
"Cliquer sur :guilabel:`Ajouter` pour imputer ces crédits sur la facture. "
"Cela termine le processus de remboursement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:176
msgid "A invoice for a rental order with outstanding credits."
msgstr "Une facture pour une commande de location avec des crédits en cours."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:180
msgid "Invoice the remaining rental charges"
msgstr "Facturer les frais de location restants"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:182
msgid ""
"On the new invoice draft, the :guilabel:`Total` amount displays the applied "
"credit note amount and deposit date. After verifying the totals, "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` to finalize the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Sur le nouveau brouillon de facture, le montant :guilabel:`Total` affiche le "
"montant de la note de crédit imputée et la date du dépôt de garantie. Après "
"avoir vérifié les totaux, cliquer sur :guilabel:`Confirmer` pour finaliser "
"la facture."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:185
msgid "Sample of a invoice for a rental order with an applied credit note."
msgstr ""
"Exemple d'une facture pour une commande de location avec une note de crédit "
"imputée."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:188
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send` to email the final invoice to the customer. For in-"
"person transactions, click :guilabel:`Pay` to process the payment."
msgstr ""
"Cliquer sur :guilabel:`Envoyer` pour envoyer la facture finale par e-mail au "
"client. Pour les transactions en personne, cliquer sur :guilabel:`Payer` "
"pour traiter le paiement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:-1
msgid ""
"This document explains how to pick up and return rental Goods (physical "
"products) and Services."
msgstr ""
"Ce document explique comment enlever et restituer des biens (produits "
"physiques) et des services de location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:13
msgid ""
"This document focuses on the pickup and return of both rental *Goods* "
"(physical products) such as clothes, computer equipment, bicycles, and "
"*Services* (physical and non-physical) such as photographer sessions, hotel "
"rooms, and catering. Refer to the :doc:`../configure_products/product_type` "
"page for more information on *Goods* and *Services*."
msgstr ""
"Ce document se concentre sur l'enlèvement et la restitution des *Biens* de "
"location (produits physiques) tels que les vêtements, le matériel "
"informatique ou les vélos, et des *Services* (physiques ou non) tels que les "
"séances photo, les chambres d'hôtel et le service traiteur. Consulter la "
"page :doc:`../configure_products/product_type` pour plus d'informations sur "
"les *Biens* et les *Services*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:18
msgid ""
"Once a rental order is confirmed, the reserved rental products are available "
"for pickup. If company policy requires a signed rental contract, it is "
"recommended to :ref:`request the customer's signature <rental/"
"create_rental_order/customer-signature>` before the rental product is picked "
"up."
msgstr ""
"Dès qu'une commande de location est confirmée, les produits de location "
"réservés peuvent être enlevés. Si la politique de l'entreprise exige un "
"contrat de location signé, il est recommandé de :ref:`demander la signature "
"du client <rental/create_rental_order/customer-signature>` avant d'enlever "
"le produit loué."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:27
msgid "Two basic configurations cover the rental product types:"
msgstr ""
"Deux configurations de base couvrent les types de produits de location :"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:29
msgid ":ref:`rental/pickup_return/physical-rental-products`"
msgstr ":ref:`rental/pickup_return/physical-rental-products`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:30
msgid ":ref:`rental/pickup_return/service-rental-products`"
msgstr ":ref:`rental/pickup_return/service-rental-products`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:37
msgid ""
"Configuration for physical rental products requires that the **Rental**, "
"**Inventory**, and **Sales** apps are installed. If product tracking is "
"required, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. In the *Traceability* section, enable the :guilabel:`Lots & "
"Serial Numbers` checkbox. Then :ref:`configure product tracking <rental/"
"products/product-tracking>` on the rental product form."
msgstr ""
"La configuration des produits physiques de location nécessite l'installation "
"des applications **Location**, **Inventaire** et **Ventes**. Si le suivi des "
"produits est requis, aller à :menuselection:`Application Inventaire --> "
"Configuration --> Paramètres`. Dans la section *Traçabilité*, cocher la "
"case :guilabel:`Lots & numéros de série`. Ensuite, :ref:`configurer le suivi "
"du produit <rental/products/product-tracking>` sur la fiche du produit de "
"location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:46
msgid "Service rental products"
msgstr "Produits de location de services"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:48
msgid ""
"Configuration for service rental products, both physical and non-physical, "
"requires the **Rental**, **Planning**, and **Sales** apps to be installed. "
"For physical service products, :ref:`configure the materials and roles "
"<rental/service_products/materials-and-roles>` in the **Planning** app "
"before creating the product."
msgstr ""
"La configuration des produits de service de location, tant physiques que non "
"physiques, nécessite l'installation des applications **Location**, "
"**Planning** et **Ventes**. Pour les produits de service "
"physiques, :ref:`configurer les matériels et les rôles <rental/"
"service_products/materials-and-roles>` dans l'application **Planning** avant "
"de créer le produit."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:53
msgid ""
"For non-physical service products, :ref:`configure employee roles <rental/"
"labor_service_products/configure-employee-roles>` in the **Planning** app "
"before creating the product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:60
msgid "Configure pick up and return availability for eCommerce products"
msgstr ""
"Configurer la disponibilité de l'enlèvement et du retour pour les produits "
"eCommerce"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:62
msgid ""
"The **Rental** app supports eCommerce configuration at :ref:`the company "
"<rental/product_type/configuration>` and product level when the **Website** "
"app and the **eCommerce** module are installed. Using the *Availabilities* "
"setting restricts the days and times the company allows pickups and returns "
"to be scheduled through the online store. To configure the rental product "
"page in the online store, refer to the :ref:`Product configuration "
"<ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` section for the **eCommerce** "
"module."
msgstr ""
"L'application **Location** prend en charge la configuration eCommerce au "
"niveau de :ref:`la société <rental/product_type/configuration>` et du "
"produit lorsque l'application **Site Web** et le module **eCommerce** sont "
"installés. Le paramètre *Disponibilités* limite les jours et les heures où "
"la société autorise la planification des enlèvements et des retours via la "
"boutique en ligne. Pour configurer la page du produit de location dans la "
"boutique en ligne, consulter la section :ref:`Configuration du produit "
"<ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` du module **eCommerce**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:72
msgid "Pick up a rental product"
msgstr "Enlever un produit de location"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:75
msgid ""
"For rental businesses that rent out locations with no stock movement, such "
"as hotel rooms, meeting rooms, and storage spaces, the pickup (check-in) and "
"return (check-out) processes are the same."
msgstr ""
"Pour les entreprises de location qui louent des emplacements sans mouvement "
"de stock, tels que des chambres d'hôtel, des salles de réunion et des "
"espaces de stockage, les processus d'enlèvement (check-in) et de retour "
"(check-out) sont les mêmes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:79
msgid ""
"To process a pickup of a rental product, go to :menuselection:`Rental app --"
"> Orders --> Orders` and select the desired rental order. "
"Click :guilabel:`Pickup`, and a *Validate a pickup* pop-up window displays, "
"listing the reserved rental product and quantity "
"in :guilabel:`Product`, :guilabel:`Reserved`, and :guilabel:`Picked-up` "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"Pour traiter l'enlèvement d'un produit de location, aller "
"à :menuselection:`Application Location --> Commandes --> Commandes` et "
"sélectionner la commande de location souhaitée. Cliquer "
"sur :guilabel:`Enlever`, et une fenêtre contextuelle *Valider un enlèvement* "
"s'affiche, répertoriant le produit de location réservé et la quantité dans "
"les colonnes :guilabel:`Produit`, :guilabel:`Réservé` et :guilabel:`Enlevé`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:84
msgid "Example of a Validate a pickup page in the Rental app."
msgstr "Exemple d'une page Valider un enlèvement dans l'application Location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:87
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:114
msgid ""
"To confirm the list, click :guilabel:`Validate`. The action updates the "
"rental order with a :guilabel:`Picked-up` badge and updates "
"the :guilabel:`Delivered` column. The action is also recorded in the rental "
"order's chatter."
msgstr ""
"Pour confirmer la liste, cliquer sur :guilabel:`Valider`. L'action met à "
"jour la commande de location avec un badge :guilabel:`Enlevé` et met à jour "
"la colonne :guilabel:`Livré`. L'action est également enregistrée dans le "
"chatter de la commande de location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:91
msgid ""
"Example of a rental order once the rental product is picked up in the Rental "
"app."
msgstr ""
"Exemple d'une commande de location une fois que le produit de location est "
"enlevé dans l'application Location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:97
msgid "Pick up a physical rental product with tracking enabled"
msgstr "Enlever un produit de location physique avec le suivi activé"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:100
msgid ""
"This process requires that the *Lots & Serial Numbers* feature in the "
"**Inventory** app be enabled and that the *Tracking* field be set to *By "
"Unique Serial Number* on the rental product form."
msgstr ""
"Ce processus nécessite que la fonctionnalité *Lots & numéros de série* de "
"l'application **Inventaire** soit activée et que le champ *Traçabilité* soit "
"défini sur *Par numéro de série unique* sur la fiche du produit de location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:104
msgid ""
"To process a pickup of a physical rental product with tracking enabled, go "
"to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Orders --> Orders` and select the desired "
"rental order. Click :guilabel:`Pickup`, and the *Validate a pickup* pop-up "
"window displays, listing the reserved rental product and quantity "
"in :guilabel:`Product`, :guilabel:`Reserved`, :guilabel:`Serial Numbers`, "
"and :guilabel:`Picked-up` columns. Check the rental product's serial number "
"and then click in the :guilabel:`Serial Numbers` column and select the "
"product's serial number from the drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"Pour traiter l'enlèvement d'un produit de location physique avec le suivi "
"activé, aller à :menuselection:`Application Location --> Commandes --> "
"Commandes` et sélectionner la commande de location souhaitée. Cliquer "
"sur :guilabel:`Enlever`, et la fenêtre contextuelle *Valider un enlèvement* "
"s'affiche, répertoriant le produit de location réservé et la quantité dans "
"les colonnes :guilabel:`Produit`, :guilabel:`Réservé`, :guilabel:`Numéros de "
"série` et :guilabel:`Enlevé`. Vérifier le numéro de série du produit de "
"location, puis cliquer dans la colonne :guilabel:`Numéros de série` et "
"sélectionner le numéro de série du produit dans la liste déroulante."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:111
msgid ""
"Example of a Validate a pickup page with product tracking enabled in the "
"Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Exemple d'une page Valider un enlèvement avec le suivi de produit activé "
"dans l'application Location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:118
msgid "Example of a rental order with a Picked-up badge in the Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Exemple d'une commande de location avec un badge Enlevé dans l'application "
"Location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:124
msgid "Pick up a rental product and a rental service"
msgstr "Enlever un produit de location et un service de location"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:127
msgid ""
"Refer to the :ref:`physical and service rental configuration requirements "
"<rental/pickup_return/configuration>` to see the necessary app installations "
"and settings."
msgstr ""
"Consulter les :ref:`exigences de configuration pour la location de biens et "
"de services <rental/pickup_return/configuration>` pour voir les "
"installations d'applications et les paramètres nécessaires."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:130
msgid ""
"When a physical rental product is rented alongside a service, it is advised "
"to pick it up before :ref:`entering time on the employee shift <rental/"
"create_rental_order/time-for-employee-shift>`, if applicable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:137
msgid "Return a rental product"
msgstr "Retourner un produit de location"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:140
msgid ""
"Regardless of whether a physical rental product is rented along with a "
"service rental product, both must be returned on the rental order. Returning "
"a rental service is the same process as returning a physical rental product "
"without tracking enabled."
msgstr ""
"Qu'un produit de location physique soit loué ou non avec un service de "
"location, les deux doivent être retournés sur la commande de location. Le "
"retour d'un service de location suit le même processus que le retour d'un "
"produit de location physique sans suivi activé."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:144
msgid ""
"When a customer returns the rental product, go to :menuselection:`Rental app "
"--> Orders --> Orders` and select the desired rental order. "
"Click :guilabel:`Return`, and the *Validate a return* pop-up window "
"displays, listing the returning rental product and quantity "
"in :guilabel:`Product`, :guilabel:`Picked-up`, and :guilabel:`Returned` "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"Quand un client retourne le produit de location, aller "
"à :menuselection:`Application Location --> Commandes --> Commandes` et "
"sélectionner la commande de location souhaitée. Cliquer "
"sur :guilabel:`Retourner`, et la fenêtre contextuelle *Valider un retour* "
"s'affiche, répertoriant le produit de location retourné et la quantité dans "
"les colonnes :guilabel:`Produit`, :guilabel:`Enlevé` et :guilabel:`Retourné`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:149
msgid "Example of a Validate a return page in the Rental app."
msgstr "Exemple d'une page Valider un retour dans l'application Location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:152
msgid ""
"To confirm the list, click :guilabel:`Validate`. The action applies "
"a :guilabel:`Returned` badge to the rental order and updates "
"the :guilabel:`Returned` column. The action is also recorded in the rental "
"order's chatter."
msgstr ""
"Pour confirmer la liste, cliquer sur :guilabel:`Valider`. L'action applique "
"un badge :guilabel:`Retourné` à la commande de location et met à jour la "
"colonne :guilabel:`Retourné`. L'action est également enregistrée dans le "
"chatter de la commande de location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:156
msgid ""
"Example of the rental order once the rental product is returned in the "
"Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Exemple de commande de location une fois le produit de location retourné "
"dans l'application Location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:162
msgid "Return a physical rental product with tracking enabled"
msgstr "Retourner un produit de location physique avec suivi activé"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:164
msgid ""
"When a customer returns the product, go to :menuselection:`Rental app --> "
"Orders --> Orders` and select the desired rental order. "
"Click :guilabel:`Return`, and the *Validate a return* pop-up window "
"displays, listing the returning rental product and quantity "
"in :guilabel:`Product`, :guilabel:`Picked-up`, :guilabel:`Serial Numbers`, "
"and :guilabel:`Returned` columns."
msgstr ""
"Quand un client retourne le produit, aller à :menuselection:`Application "
"Location --> Commandes --> Commandes` et sélectionner la commande de "
"location souhaitée. Cliquer sur :guilabel:`Retourner`, et la fenêtre "
"contextuelle *Valider un retour* s'affiche, répertoriant le produit de "
"location retourné et la quantité dans les "
"colonnes :guilabel:`Produit`, :guilabel:`Enlevé`, :guilabel:`Numéros de "
"série` et :guilabel:`Retourné`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:169
msgid ""
"Example of a Validate a return page with product tracking enabled in the "
"Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Exemple d'une page Valider un retour avec le suivi de produit activé dans "
"l'application Location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:172
msgid ""
"Verify that the returned rental product has the same serial number as the "
"one listed in the :guilabel:`Serial Numbers` column. If the serial numbers "
"don't match, click into the :guilabel:`Serial Numbers` column and select the "
"correct serial number from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Vérifier que le produit de location retourné a le même numéro de série que "
"celui indiqué dans la colonne :guilabel:`Numéros de série`. Si les numéros "
"de série ne correspondent pas, cliquer dans la colonne :guilabel:`Numéros de "
"série` et sélectionner le bon numéro de série dans le menu déroulant."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:176
msgid ""
"Once the rental product's quantity and serial number match, "
"click :guilabel:`Validate`. The action applies a :guilabel:`Returned` badge "
"to the rental order and updates the :guilabel:`Returned` column. The action "
"is also recorded in the rental order's chatter."
msgstr ""
"Une fois que la quantité et le numéro de série du produit de location "
"correspondent, cliquer sur :guilabel:`Valider`. Cette action applique un "
"badge :guilabel:`Retourné` à la commande de location et met à jour la "
"colonne :guilabel:`Retourné`. L'action est également enregistrée dans le "
"chatter de la commande de location."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:180
