"rental_order_dashboard/user-rental-orders>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Gérer les commandes de location prioritaires du jour <rental/"
"rental_order_dashboard/user-rental-orders>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:130
msgid "Managing a sales team"
msgstr "Gérer une équipe commerciale"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:132
msgid ""
