"testeur (nom et mot de passe)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:75
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`APP IP Address Management`, select :guilabel:`IP address(es) "
"unavailable` and enter \"The application is cloud-hosted.\""
msgstr ""
"Pour :guilabel:`APP IP Address Management`, sélectionner :guilabel:`IP "
