"cloud.\""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:78
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Submit` to process the application. The app creation takes "
"approximately 24 hours. Once approved, note the :guilabel:`App Key` "
"and :guilabel:`App Secret`."
msgstr ""
"Cliquer sur :guilabel:`Envoyer` pour traiter la candidature. La création de "
"l'app prend environ 24 heures. Une fois approuvée, noter la :guilabel:`Clé "
"de l'App` et le :guilabel:`Secret de l'App`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:82
