"mapper les SKU aux :guilabel:`Internal References` dans un tableur, et "
"importer les mappages mis à jour dans Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:157
msgid ""
"Test catalog synchronization with a small product set to verify SKU mappings "
"before full import."
msgstr ""
