#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:97
msgid ""
"First go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Pricelists` and "
"create a new pricelist for the seasonal discount. Click :guilabel:`Add a "
